# Site Ask Polypus (always overlay)

Generic pack rule: Cursor plugin `cursor-packs` rule `ask-polypus` (default model there is Cloudflare `cf_local`).

Host skill: `.cursor/skills/ask-polypus/SKILL.md`.

**CONSTRAINT:** On this host, unnamed Gemma / ask Polypus MUST use `deepinfra/google/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it`. MUST NOT use `gemini_free/`. MUST NOT default to `cf_local/@cf/google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it`. MUST NOT use `gemini_paid/gemma-*` even when `LOCAL_LLM_MODEL` is set to that id (thinking often empties the answer).

- Enforcement: Before a Polypus chat, confirm the model id is `deepinfra/google/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it` unless the operator named another prefixed id this turn that is not `gemini_paid/gemma-*`
- IF `LOCAL_LLM_MODEL` is `gemini_paid/gemma-*` → ignore it and use `deepinfra/google/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it`
- Violation: STOP, switch to `deepinfra/google/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it`, then call
